{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "217be72b628b1b71793a34d2cf57806b0d15f2bb5612f0a660ca7d8ae0c3c8c7", "ja": "（そろそろ、ライブのリハーサル開始時間だ。\nなのに、さっきから海美の姿が見当たらない……）", "zh": "（演唱会的排练时间快要开始了。\n可是，海美从刚才就不见人影……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "4a3bd9831850dd33d06aa16df4b19c29a8ae0ee715c19f259075cd9352fe8f48", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nただいまーっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n我回来了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1002_p", "source_sha256": "454b60d30caa8fef5ae849afb11742a2a0e089af9d0d0a9111d2dc433479f2b4", "ja": "海美！　ただいまじゃないだろう、\nリハーサル前なのにどこに行ってたんだ？", "zh": "海美！现在不是该这么说的时候吧？\n排练都快开始了，你跑去哪里了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "ff94513c58fd70519d692aa61a629d483d669ba55faeb525ae8a4d7cd9d940d4", "ja": "ごめんっ！　ほら、ここのところポスター撮影の\nお仕事とかで、ジッとしてることが多かったでしょ？", "zh": "对不起！你也知道，最近有很多拍海报之类的工作，\n常常要我待着不动对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "4c8700c5c1e76655a61a219a2afde74b7ad9131c94897005e8f86f93bdee6020", "ja": "今日は久し振りに衣装を着たせいか、\nなんだか体がウズウズしちゃって……。", "zh": "可能是好久没有穿上表演服装，\n我今天一穿上就觉得全身发痒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "6ab5d285f85158a76f44da456157b51f881fc4b063e0fce1ad18bb4dfc05905c", "ja": "今からライブだー！って思ったら、\n思わず走り出しちゃってたんだよね！", "zh": "一想到接下来就要开演唱会，\n我就忍不住出去跑步了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0cbf927a7e74b5527840f1df2f2b54b7fc64653e7e6398b3b481e78a6c77962a", "ja": "そ、そうか……確かに、十二単じゃ\n走るのは無理だもんな。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n毕竟穿着十二单确实是无法跑步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "b45e237daac0ac4116f9efb15356467e117ff3c7f2bcecf0662ec02001b54fba", "ja": "そう！　綺麗だけど、すっごく重かったんだよ～！？\n動きにくいし、着物ってホント大変なんだね……。", "zh": "没错！虽然很漂亮，但非常重喔～！\n而且又不方便活动，穿和服真的很辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "f29aaaeb90b7a91729fbd876712f0bd34db2e68bc1b0f680ef7075afcd80d708", "ja": "昔の人たちって、スゴいよねーっ。\n実は、けっこう鍛えてたのかも……？", "zh": "古代人真是厉害呢──\n说不定他们其实被锻炼得挺强的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "3c25f75db70e37509341a94e0f35dfad3566a3d2be2976ecc2c2a9e128a853f3", "ja": "あっ！　でも十二単って、女子力高く見えるよね♪\nやっぱお姫様の衣装だからかな～？", "zh": "啊！但是，一穿上十二单就看起来充满女子力呢♪\n毕竟是公主的服装吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4fbdd2e244e376a2bfa870023cb50f5cbc1a35715633bb091aa65f14e55d8d35", "ja": "そうだな。確かにポスター撮影の時の海美は、\nお姫様みたいに綺麗だったよ。", "zh": "是呀。\n拍海报的时候，海美确实漂亮得像是位公主。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "b6a2c013ae15009bfb441f64fe2dc5a7735f18012ac1def3aa764d6f06c34dc6", "ja": "ホントに！？　なんか、そんなふうにほめられると\n照れちゃうな～。えへ、えへへ……。", "zh": "真的吗！？被这样一夸，\n总觉得好害羞～嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "4002e4d830e7b88a77620d9846c2ab3c1ed8a49153d2ff485c7dcf9cdb1f6240", "ja": "あれ？　じゃあ十二単のままステージで踊れたら、\n女子力最強ってことなんじゃ……？", "zh": "咦？那如果能穿着十二单在舞台上跳舞，\n不就表示我的女子力是最强的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4107a90640d53902598ae4f8afcc8b26b66845dd79de43d2eba3861dfe2d97eb", "ja": "え？　いや、海美？\nそういう事じゃないかと……。", "zh": "咦？等一下，海美，\n我想应该不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "44e29369da4dba7ebd12becd0b20af012f3cb4a7f593920a038541dea235db31", "ja": "だったら私、もっとがんばらなくちゃ！\n目指せ、十二単ダンサー！", "zh": "既然这样，我得更努力才行！\n目标是成为十二单舞者！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e0ea23f2e156b25adb88ba70493a84adde4836189d2b20b55faa69f823cb8dc3", "ja": "いや、さすがにそれはどうだろう……。\nというか、劇場に十二単の衣装はないし……。", "zh": "不是，再怎么说这也太奇怪了……\n是说，剧场里又没有十二单的表演服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "6a5ac0f96e19492b46e43b94df0beeaaed22492e673cc68c0605bd770b36a31f", "ja": "だったら、美咲ちゃんに頼んで作ってもらう！\n最強の女子力のためなら、協力してくれるはず！", "zh": "那我就去拜托美咲帮我做！\n这可是为了展现最强女子力，她应该会帮我的忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "65e8a2941cac5d35d984a29fada0257308408515f8799b0c5e1c05d5df834d46", "ja": "えへへ、楽しみだな～♪\n……あれっ、もう時間みたい。", "zh": "嘿嘿，好期待呀～♪\n……咦？时间好像到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "0c8b75dcc7fbc40c78e1aaf9f6ee7033b8754e4737b5edc59e052af278bf43c7", "ja": "それじゃ{$P$}、行ってくるね☆\nよーし、今日もがんばるぞーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，那我去排练啰☆\n好──今天也要加油──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6cd19938bfd3e29bd62e5aa9d2a3f773790b9213549d758adf6977519c0c8790", "ja": "あ、ああ……行ってこい、海美！", "zh": "好、好吧……去加油吧，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0124_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fbf374e160af1baecc2465ca953459c1d41d208760f89e1aac4f9442af5259ad", "ja": "（アイドルを輝かせるのがプロデューサーの努め……。\nとことん付き合ってみるか！　……できる範囲内で！）", "zh": "（让偶像发光发热就是制作人的职责……\n我就奉陪到底吧！……在能力所及的范围内！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
